<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT SRI LANKA BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT SRI LANKA BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Sri Lanka by eight wickets in a Singer Champions Trophy cricket match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 189 all out, 50 overs; Pakistan 193 for two, 46.4 overs.</p>
</text>
